Cecilia Library

Each file in this repository states its own licence:

- music/**: the "licence" field of each score (or "info.copyright" of each
  recording): one of public-domain, CC0-1.0, CC-BY-4.0, CC-BY-SA-4.0.
- organs/**: CC0 1.0 Universal.

CC0 1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
CC BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
CC BY-SA 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

Repository scripts and workflows: CC0 1.0.
